lt=\"警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做2. 釐清資金性質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908483381137408091643.jpeg/zEy5KBwpZUf-UcafGhwYDJ1BxXK8BbD6SyLVyUsi1ck\"/><figcaption>警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做2. 釐清資金性質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908485507780608436925.jpeg/7BWM3YLxdkyoOU027A5RmMG2mJws5Dn7EuRHphLkR6Y\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908475357040640206783.jpeg/nEx1fQujABF_2Q5m0Ri1ObPKkJYHAU-3RWPGukVjxro\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908477936668672926473.jpeg/7rn25Aj0Yj5TnqqO6YW_1qpCfZ9OhlpmHpEamB6RGpg\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908480331747328794523.jpeg/dMQtwfwLMDt_n3ZYcvjpmwNd9_LdlH-QN71g5je9YOY\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Japaholic」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T09:20:17.635820+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1722,"images":24,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}